@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Improved the error message shown when :func:`pytest.skip` is used at module level without ``allow_module_level=True``, making it clearer that this would skip the entire module and pointing to the ``@pytest.mark.skip``/``@pytest.mark.skipif`` decorators for skipping individual tests.
